    "note": "Skills a v0.19.2 home can hold after files were removed or a daemon was killed: a skill whose live directory is gone but whose version snapshot remains, a skill whose version snapshot is gone, a creation (reserve) killed after publishing its files and before committing (an active operation row and its lock), and a never-published empty skill that an agent still names. One agent references the skill that loses its version snapshot, and a workflow uses that agent. The skill that loses only its live directory is restored by the new version itself: its first start copies the live files back from the version snapshot and verifies it again (skillVersion.ts reconcileSkillLiveFiles, skillBootVerify.ts). The SKILL.md bytes are the released ledger's, so the version row's content hash (copied from the ledger) matches the snapshot that remains."
  },
